# Wallpapers you drop in yourself - large binaries, and they are a curation
# decision rather than source. The rendered slides are derived output.
# state/ IS committed: queue.json and backgrounds-used.json are the pipeline's
# memory, and losing them means repeating hooks and backgrounds.
backgrounds/*/*
!backgrounds/*/.gitkeep
out/*
!out/.gitkeep

# Fetched by `node slideshow.mjs fonts`. Google Fonts are OFL - redistributable
# with the licence attached, but there is no reason to carry 700 KB of binaries
# when one command pulls them.
fonts/*.ttf

# Rotated TikTok refresh token. Never commit this.
state/.refresh-token

node_modules/
package-lock.json
